">\n          <img src=\"https://www.haifa-group.com/themes/haifa/images/default-images.jpg\">\n        <div class=\"link\"></div>\n  </div>\n</a>\n</div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\">\n<a href=\"/crop-research/positive-contribution-potassic-fertilization-cotton\">\n  <div class=\"views-field-title text-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"title\">\n<span>Positive contribution to potassic fertilization in cotton</span>\n</div>\n    <div class=\"teaser\">\n                    \n            <div class=\"field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\">  Two foliar sprays of Multi-K increased yield by 24%, in comparison with the same treatment with MOP...\n\n</div>\n      \n            </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"image\">\n          <img src=\"https://www.haifa-group.com/themes/haifa/images/default-images.jpg\">\n        <div class=\"link\"></div>\n  </div>\n</a>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n    \n\n  \n  \n\n          \n</div>",
