  "growing-beautiful-limoniums-greenhouses": {
    "slug": "growing-beautiful-limoniums-greenhouses",
    "title": "Growing beautiful limoniums in greenhouses",
    "image": "/crops/banners/crop-guide-ornamentals-limonium-fertilizers-crop-guide.png",
    "description": "Haifa&#039;s fertilization program for growing limoniums with Haifa fertilizers, to achieve optimal plant nutrition &amp; excellent yield",
    "htmlContent": "<h2>Follow Haifa's fertilization program in order to meet the limonium nutrients demand</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Soil type: <strong>Medium</strong><br>\nPlant density:&nbsp;36,000 – 40,000 plants/ha<br>\nFertilization setup:&nbsp;<strong>quantitative</strong></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<table cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<th rowspan=\"2\">Developmental stage</th>\n\t\t\t<th colspan=\"3\">\n\t\t\t<p>Nutrient demand (kg/ha/day)</p>\n\t\t\t</th>\n\t\t\t<th colspan=\"4\">\n\t\t\t<p>Recommended fertilizers (kg/ha/day)</p>\n\t\t\t</th>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<th>\n\t\t\t<p>N</p>\n\t\t\t</th>\n\t\t\t<th>\n\t\t\t<p>P<sub>2</sub>O<sub>5</sub></p>\n\t\t\t</th>\n\t\t\t<th>\n\t\t\t<p>K<sub>2</sub>O</p>\n\t\t\t</th>\n\t\t\t<th>\n\t\t\t<p><a href=\"/poly-feed™-drip-8\">Poly-Feed 20-20-20</a>*</p>\n\t\t\t</th>\n\t\t\t<th>\n\t\t\t<p><a href=\"https://www.haifa-group.com/plant-nutrition\">Multi-K</a></p>\n\t\t\t</th>\n\t\t\t<th>\n\t\t\t<p><a href=\"https://www.haifa-group.com/haifa-map™-mono-ammonium-phosphate-12-61-0\">Haifa MAP</a></p>\n\t\t\t</th>\n\t\t\t<th>\n\t\t\t<p>A.N.</p>\n\t\t\t</th>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>Establishment</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>1.9</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>1.9</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>1.9</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>7 - 11.4</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>0</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>0</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>0</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>Vegetative + Flowering</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>2.3 - 3.1</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>0.5</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>2.9 - 3.6</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>0</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>5.7 - 8.6</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>0.85</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>5 - 6.4</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n\n\n\n\n<p>* <a href=\"https://www.haifa-group.com/poly-feed-drip-1\">Poly-Feed 23-7-23</a> is preferable if soil P status is high.&nbsp;<br>\nIt is essential that either Poly-Feed formulae will be enriched with micro-nutrients.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.haifa-group.com/plant-nutrition\">Multi-K</a> (13-0-46);<a href=\"https://www.haifa-group.com/haifa-map™-mono-ammonium-phosphate-12-61-0\"> Haifa MAP</a> (12-61-0); A.N. (ammonium nitrate, 33-0-0)</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h4>Nutritional sufficiency ranges</h4>\n\n<p>(in leaves from new growth, taken at summer)</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<table cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>N</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>3.18-3.38 %</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Fe</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>86-123 ppm</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>P</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>3.18-3.38 %</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Zn</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>102-260 ppm</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>K</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>2.20-2.83 %</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Mn</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>47-79 ppm</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Ca</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>0.49-0.72 %</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>B</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>17-22 ppm</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>Mg</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>0.42-0.56 %</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>S</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p>N.A.</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p><iframe id=\"ob_iframe\" src=\"https://widgets.outbrain.com/nanoWidget/externals/obFrame/obFrame.htm#pid=5105&amp;dmpenabled=true&amp;filterDMP=&amp;csenabled=true&amp;d=RoicLl_YY-KJCU87OPjLIqtrpnZG1ykV0u43Q2lCEMthdCtmrOWTNmIpOhF_LQ2P\" style=\"display: none; width: 1px; height: 1px;\"></iframe></p></div>\n      \n          <h2 class=\"title-decoration\"><span>You may also be interested in this</span></h2>\n      \n<div class=\"box-view view\"><div class=\"views-content\">\n\n                <div class=\"views-row\">\n           <div class=\"field__item\">\n<a href=\"/multi-k-potassium-nitrate-fertilizers-formula\">\n  <div class=\"views-field-title text-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"title\">\n<span>Potassium Nitrate Fertilizer Products</span>\n</div>\n    <div class=\"teaser\">\n                    \n            <div class=\"field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\">  Range of KNO 3 Fertilizer Products - Multi-K™ Multi-K™, Haifa’s potassium nitrate , is a unique...\n\n</div>\n      \n            </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"image\">\n          \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-thumbnail field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.haifa-group.com/sites/default/files/styles/branch/public/2026-04/banner_pn_lobby.jpg?itok=T-lwijNe\" width=\"666\" height=\"450\" alt=\"\" />\n\n\n</div>\n      \n        <div class=\"link\"></div>\n  </div>\n</a>\n</div>\n        </div>\n        \n</div></div>",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.haifa-group.com/growing-beautiful-limoniums-greenhouses"
  },
