    "description": "Nutrigation",
    "htmlContent": "Onion crops, known for their shallow root systems and sensitivity to salinity, demand precise and...\n\n</div>\n      \n            </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"image\">\n          \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-thumbnail field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.haifa-group.com/sites/default/files/styles/branch/public/2024-06/Yishai_0.jpg?itok=VqrxdigA\" width=\"666\" height=\"450\" alt=\"\" />\n\n\n</div>\n      \n        <div class=\"link\"></div>\n  </div>\n</a>\n</div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\">\n<a href=\"/articles/multicote-agri-handbook\">\n  <div class=\"views-field-title text-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"title\">\n<span>Multicote Agri Handbook</span>\n</div>\n    <div class=\"teaser\">\n                    \n            <div class=\"field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\">  Multicote™ Agri, a range of controlled release fertilizers for agriculture and horticulture, has...\n\n</div>\n      \n            </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"image\">\n          \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-thumbnail field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.haifa-group.com/sites/default/files/styles/branch/public/2024-03/the-health-benefits-of-onions-main-image-700-350.jpg?itok=DVENrtLS\" width=\"666\" height=\"450\" alt=\"\" />\n\n\n</div>\n      \n        <div class=\"link\"></div>\n  </div>\n</a>\n</div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\">\n<a href=\"/crop-research/white-onion-bulb%E2%80%99s-size-increased-multi-k-application\">\n  <div class=\"views-field-title text-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"title\">\n<span>White onion bulb’s size increased by Multi-K application</span>\n</div>\n    <div class=\"teaser\">\n                    \n            <div class=\"field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\">  Side dressing of Multi-K was carried out before bulbs enlargement Crop/cultivar White Onion /...\n\n</div>\n      \n            </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"image\">\n          <img src=\"https://www.haifa-group.com/themes/haifa/images/default-images.jpg\">\n        <div class=\"link\"></div>\n  </div>\n</a>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n    \n\n  \n  \n\n          \n</div>",
